# Shop POS & Management System — Backend

REST API backend for a Shop POS & Management System built with TypeScript, Express.js, MongoDB, and Mongoose.

The backend provides authentication, authorization, product management, inventory management, POS sales, payment tracking, reporting, profit calculation, employee management, and shop settings.

## Overview

The backend follows a modular architecture designed to separate business functionality into independent modules.

It provides secure API endpoints for the frontend application and handles authentication, validation, database operations, stock updates, sales calculations, and reporting.

## Core Features

### Authentication

- User registration
- Email OTP verification
- Login
- Logout
- Access token authentication
- Refresh token mechanism
- Forgot password
- Password reset
- Secure password hashing
- Protected routes

### Authorization

